WEBVTT

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:15.910
We were scalded by the tribulations of love,

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:22.330
and suffered the deluge of bloodshed as we traversed its dark ocean.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:28.270
The cascade of light pierces the heavenly canopy,

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:40.270
revealing the fate of the star-cross'd lovers.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:47.020
Chapter Twelve

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:47.020
Black Tomb

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.360
Move.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:56.860
I refuse.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.990
I cannot let you pass.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:12.840
I have been wielding a blade since before you were swimming around in your father's scrotum.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.300
Yet you still intend to challenge my swordsmanship?

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.800
Such a thing had not crossed my mind.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.720
Then, what did you intend?

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.100
A flute.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.600
A flute?

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.650
A flute and a drum.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.110
In the distant past...

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.910
A hundred years?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.410
No, further back than that.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.750
A past stretching back more than a thousand years.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.750
Everything...

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.050
began in this decrepit hut.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:09.700
It has felt like an age since we last met, Lady Kuromitsu.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.280
I am Priest Musashi.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.930
It has been a long time.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:42.440
After a thousand years, your humble servant, Benkei, has at last found you again.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.900
Ever since that moment–

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:51.570
No. Ever since I decapitated my master, Yoshitsune no Kuro,

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.070
his blood has drenched my face...

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:57.160
and furred up my tongue.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:07.460
Why? Why have you done this to us?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.220
I...

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:18.260
I was madly in love with you.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:27.060
I could not abandon my feelings back then.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:33.150
As I witnessed the passion rising between you and my master,

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:38.580
the aching in my chest grew more and more pronounced.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:46.830
I desired my master's death, so that I could claim you for my own.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.500
These feelings escalated...

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:54.590
and then took hold of me.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:01.600
Those impious devils who were bewitched by the mystery of everlasting life...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.520
During the Heian Period,

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:13.440
they heard tales of the Yaobikuni appearing in Adachigahara.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.950
To appropriate the ageless, immortal blood,

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.410
they cursed me...

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:21.040
and commanded me to decapitate my master.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:35.010
At that point, your body became free from Death's grip.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:41.260
Indeed. I am not dead.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:46.730
However, this is not true immortality.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.730
Presumably,

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:55.490
when I swallowed Master Kuro's blood,
it had not yet had time to fully coalesce with your own.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.700
As the years tumble by,

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:01.200
I continue to age.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:06.040
I have become unsightly. I am decaying.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.710
As I agonized over what to do with this body of mine,

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:18.930
I subconsciously became fascinated with
uncovering the meaning of life once more.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:23.310
Then, I told Hasegawa to aid you in your plan,

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:27.180
because of his expertise with technology.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.810
Indeed.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.980
I take it that your plan from the beginning...

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:39.280
was to create Kuon with the intention of exchanging his head with Kuro's.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.000
Such a fearsome woman.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:52.790
Still, that is what makes you beautiful.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:11:00.380
There is something I must confess to you, Lady Kuromitsu.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.350
For the last one thousand years,

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:10.900
not a day has gone by without my thoughts turning to you.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:17.320
Not a day where I have not uttered your name.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:24.200
I love you from the depths of my heart.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:34.080
I have lived to this day so that I could tell you this.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:57.190
My lord.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:00.690
My dearest Kuro. How much of this conversation have you–

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:02.950
I heard everything.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.990
Then, what thoughts dwell within your mind?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.200
Will you strike me down where I stand?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:15.790
Benkei, I have long forgotten any grudge I felt towards you.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.210
And yet...

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.460
And yet...?

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:23.220
Our score must be settled.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.690
It has ended.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.740
Yes. However, I still feel nervous.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.530
Was I mistaken? My body is heavy.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.830
It feels as though my blood is starting to coagulate.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.580
Fret not. Soon, everything will return to the way it was.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.290
Is that so?

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.840
You are not complete.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.590
The healing abilities of your body are unable to keep pace with you.

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:30.720
My body...

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:35.600
Yes. That is why there is nothing to worry about.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.820
Endure a little longer.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:00.870
Fret not...

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:06.960
There is nothing to worry about...

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.470
I have created a body for you.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:17.020
Please use this, my dearest.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.080
My head is being embraced.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:47.630
She holds it meekly in her embrace.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.590
So, that's how it is?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.590
How many times has this taken place?

00:15:54.390 --> 00:16:00.100
When I'm merely a head, I remember everything.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:07.400
Is this... not enough?

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:14.110
Please, let me die.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.080
What are you saying?

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:24.250
Haven't you again returned safely to my side?

00:16:25.390 --> 00:16:27.750
For all eternity, I must...

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:33.470
suffer this body, this youthful countenance!

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.800
Please do not leave me alone.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:49.150
Now, everything can start anew after you awaken.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:55.450
It is only through your endless pursuit...

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:59.910
that I am able to live my immortal life.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:06.670
I am sure that you will find me next time as well.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:15.550
Let us go together, my beloved Kuro.

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:20.310
To the end of time.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.460
When did I fall asleep?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.670
It was so sudden.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:57.680
Where has that woman...

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.510
Kuromitsu...

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.930
gone?

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.790
Have you heard those rumors about vampires?

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.290
Vampires? Like Count Dracula?

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.050
I've heard there have been some prowling around the city lately.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.880
So, you're Kuro, huh?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:40.300
Still, you've got some muscle there.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:46.730
If you want Kuromitsu back, join us and fight!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.230
Kuromitsu...

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:56.280
You reckon Kuromitsu's actually there, Hasegawa?

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.610
I do.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:02.120
This time, using these hands...

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.530
I've been very patient....

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.660
This is almost like... love.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.540
You sure know how to keep people waiting.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:36.730
The only information I can give you at this moment...

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.530
is that you and I...

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:41.320
are bound together by an unbreakable bond;

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.950
one that surpasses any that exists between a man and woman in this world.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.530
My lord.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.190
What ails you?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.990
This is most unlike you.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.620
I feel as though...

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.450
I have been dreaming...

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.870
It is advisable to stay alert.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.910
Our pursuers are amassing.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.920
There no longer remains a single moment that we can spare.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.630
It is growing dark...

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.380
and we have almost run out of water.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.360
If it is indeed shelter,

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:42.970
we shall request admittance for the night.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.810
What truly ails you?

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:50.640
It is nothing.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.890
This merely seems familiar...

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.650
Perhaps you are fatigued?

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:59.320
Yes, perhaps that is the reason.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.360
It must be.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.950
Let us venture forth.

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:34.020
Fin
